      "date": "2026-05-08T09:08:00.000Z",
      "title": "Garware Technical Fibres Limited (BSE:509557) announces an Equity Buyback for 1,617,500 shares, representing 1.63% for INR 1,100 million.",
      "body": "Garware Technical Fibres Limited (BSE:509557) announces a share repurchase program. Under the program, the company will repurchase up to 1,617,500 shares, representing 1.63% of its share capital for INR 1,100 million. The shares will be repurchased at a price of INR 680 per share. The company has fixed May 20, 2026 as the Record Date for the offer. As of March 31, 2026, the company had 99,265,845 shares in issue.",
      "keyDevTypeId": "232",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
