      "date": "2026-04-25T20:06:46.000Z",
      "title": "Price target decreased by 7.1% to ₹831",
      "body": "Down from ₹895, the current price target is an average from 3 analysts. New target price is 33% above last closing price of ₹627. Stock is down 27% over the past year. The company is forecast to post earnings per share of ₹21.24 for next year compared to ₹23.32 last year.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
